/* AgentKit UI strings (zh-Hans)
 *
 * Keys are dotted and grouped by area: pane.* button.* mcp.* skill.* session.*
 * Both tables must carry exactly the same key set — Tests/main.swift asserts it.
 * Filled in by task-3.
 *
 * Only text the user can see lives here: titles, buttons, field labels,
 * placeholders, notice banners, empty states, errors and `.help(...)` tooltips.
 * Logs, AGENTKIT_* variable names, SF Symbol names, file paths and the key names
 * of JSON / frontmatter (id / name / apiKey / tools …) stay out: those labels
 * have to match the real keys in the user's files, so translating them is wrong.
 */

